            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, petitioners responded that proceeding voluntarily before a magistrate indicates consent under \u00a7\u202f636(c)(1)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Frost",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "68c1690f074181cc8644817f744cd23cd5564496b905f23e8d16205d2efeb51d",
