            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Frost, ms. Frost emphasized that statutes require express consent before a magistrate may act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Eskow",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "68c1690f074181cc8644817f744cd23cd5564496b905f23e8d16205d2efeb51d",
