            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Eskow, ms. Eskow highlighted that Congress anticipated a need to protect voluntariness, making it a matter of administrative discretion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "68c1690f074181cc8644817f744cd23cd5564496b905f23e8d16205d2efeb51d",
